    "title": "Indiana woman arrested in connection to CSAM investigation in California - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By WKRC ,\n21 hours ago KOKOMO, Ind. (WKRC) - An Indiana woman was arrested in connection to a child sexual abuse material (CSAM) investigation in the State of California.. According to the Kokomo Police Department, 45-year-old Stacy Coffman was arrested Wednesday on a California warrant accusing her of offenses involving alleged contact with a minor and harmful material. Read full article",
